# U6 report: v1 deletion set (uncommitted, nothing staged)

The v1 deletion is done and the JVM, Node, Dart and `:demo` lanes all pass. Two things are not verified: the cljd REPL doesn't start, because of a bug that was already committed before this unit, and I couldn't run the Node REPL at all. There are six departures from the plan, all listed below.

## 1. Deletions (26 files: the plan's 25 plus one)

**The plan's 25:** `src/cljc/yin/repl.cljc`, `src/cljd/yin/repl/flutter.cljd`, `src/clj/yin/repl/runner.clj`, `bin/yin_repl_main.dart`, `src/clj/yin/vm/telemetry_server/jvm.clj`, `src/cljs/yin/vm/telemetry_server/node.cljs`, `src/cljs/datomworld/demo/yin_repl.cljs`, `src/cljc/yin/vm.cljc`, `src/cljc/yin/vm/{ast_walker,engine,ffi,runtime_adapter,stream_driver,telemetry}.cljc`, `test/yin/repl_test.cljc`, `test/yin/vm/{ast_conversion,ast_walker,engine,ffi,runtime_adapter,runtime_regression,stream_driver,telemetry}_test.cljc`, `test/yin/vm/test_utils.cljc`, `test/bench/stream_optimization_bench.cljc`.

**Not in the plan:** `test/datomworld/demo/yin_repl_test.cljs` (reason in section 5).

**Local cleanup (not tracked by git):** I removed the 9 stale Dart copies of deleted tests: `test/cljd-out/yin/repl-test_test.dart` and the eight `test/cljd-out/yin/vm/*-test_test.dart`. I did this before any cljd run. The `await_test` copy was already gone; only `dao/await-test_test.dart` is left. I also removed the two empty `telemetry_server/` folders.

